{"seq":1,"slug":"digital-economy","title":"数字经济","stage":"DONE","chapterCount":6,"docCount":23,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/vocational/vocational-bachelor/digital-economy","introMarkdown":"# 数字经济 简介\n\n数字经济专业是职业本科教育中面向数字化产业转型的核心交叉学科，融合经济学、管理学与计算机科学三大知识体系，培养能够驾驭数据驱动型商业模式的高层次应用型人才。2026年教育部发布的《关于深化职业教育教学关键要素改革的意见》明确将数字经济列为战略急需专业方向，强调产教融合与技术迭代的同步对接。\n\n本专业围绕\"数字技术+经济管理\"双支柱构建课程体系，学生既需掌握Python编程、大数据分析、区块链等技术工具，又需理解平台经济学、数字营销、数字金融等商业逻辑，最终形成跨领域的复合型问题解决能力。\n\n第一章**数字技术基础**奠定编程与数据处理的技术底座，涵盖Python数据分析、数据库与云计算架构、区块链与新兴技术三大模块，使学生具备将经济问题转化为可计算模型的核心能力。\n\n第二章**平台经济与运营**聚焦数字经济的商业本质，深入解析平台经济模式、数字营销与电商运营、数字金融与支付系统，帮助学生理解网络效应、双边市场等核心规律。\n\n第三章**数据分析与应用**培养数据驱动决策能力，涵盖数据挖掘与可视化、商业智能与决策支持、AI应用场景三个层次，使学生能够从海量数据中提取商业洞察。\n\n第四章**数字创新实践**面向真实产业场景，通过数字化转型案例、创新创业实践、合规治理与伦理三个维度，培养学生解决复杂现实问题的综合能力。\n\n建议学习路径：先夯实第一章的技术基础，再通过第二章理解商业逻辑，进而用第三章的数据分析方法论贯穿前两章知识，最终在第四章的实践项目中实现知识整合与能力输出。\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"digital-technology-foundations","title":"数字技术基础","docCount":6,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/vocational/vocational-bachelor/digital-economy/digital-technology-foundations","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"programming-and-data-foundations","title":"编程与数据基础","url":"/l-doc-books/education/vocational/vocational-bachelor/digital-economy/digital-technology-foundations/programming-and-data-foundations"},{"seq":1,"slug":"python-programming-data","title":"Python 编程与数据处理","url":"/l-doc-books/education/vocational/vocational-bachelor/digital-economy/digital-technology-foundations/python-programming-data"},{"seq":2,"slug":"database-and-cloud-computing","title":"数据库与云计算","url":"/l-doc-books/education/vocational/vocational-bachelor/digital-economy/digital-technology-foundations/database-and-cloud-computing"},{"seq":2,"slug":"database-bigdata-platforms","title":"数据库与大数据平台","url":"/l-doc-books/education/vocational/vocational-bachelor/digital-economy/digital-technology-foundations/database-bigdata-platforms"},{"seq":3,"slug":"ai-machine-learning-intro","title":"人工智能与机器学习导论","url":"/l-doc-books/education/vocational/vocational-bachelor/digital-economy/digital-technology-foundations/ai-machine-learning-intro"},{"seq":3,"slug":"blockchain-and-emerging-tech","title":"区块链与新兴技术","url":"/l-doc-books/education/vocational/vocational-bachelor/digital-economy/digital-technology-foundations/blockchain-and-emerging-tech"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"digital-economy-theory","title":"数字经济理论","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/vocational/vocational-bachelor/digital-economy/digital-economy-theory","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"digital-economy-overview","title":"数字经济概论与运行规律","url":"/l-doc-books/education/vocational/vocational-bachelor/digital-economy/digital-economy-theory/digital-economy-overview"},{"seq":2,"slug":"platform-economics","title":"平台经济学与商业模式","url":"/l-doc-books/education/vocational/vocational-bachelor/digital-economy/digital-economy-theory/platform-economics"},{"seq":3,"slug":"digital-finance-blockchain","title":"数字金融与区块链技术","url":"/l-doc-books/education/vocational/vocational-bachelor/digital-economy/digital-economy-theory/digital-finance-blockchain"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"platform-economy-operations","title":"平台经济与运营","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/vocational/vocational-bachelor/digital-economy/platform-economy-operations","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"platform-economics-models","title":"平台经济学模型","url":"/l-doc-books/education/vocational/vocational-bachelor/digital-economy/platform-economy-operations/platform-economics-models"},{"seq":2,"slug":"digital-marketing-ecommerce","title":"数字营销与电商运营","url":"/l-doc-books/education/vocational/vocational-bachelor/digital-economy/platform-economy-operations/digital-marketing-ecommerce"},{"seq":3,"slug":"digital-finance-payments","title":"数字金融与支付","url":"/l-doc-books/education/vocational/vocational-bachelor/digital-economy/platform-economy-operations/digital-finance-payments"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"data-analytics-applications","title":"数据分析与应用","docCount":5,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/vocational/vocational-bachelor/digital-economy/data-analytics-